<title>USA: China buys 28,000 tonnes of US soyoil-US exporters.</title>
<headline>China buys 28,000 tonnes of US soyoil-US exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has purchased 28,000 tonnes of U.S. soyoil for July shipment, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>&quot;They're (China) continuously buying at the moment but most of it comes from South America, said one soyoil trader. &quot;This was a special case.&quot;</p>
<p>Current prices in Brazil and Argentina are still more attractive to importers than those in the U.S., exporters said.</p>
<p>The U.S. sale to China took place two or three days ago, exporters said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312-480-8720))</p>
</text>
